"Emeric was once a mortal hunter whose luck never ran out."
"Emeric led the band of mortals who overthrew the old pantheon."
"Emeric cheated on Maranor while shaped as a golden manatee, then fled her wrath."
"Maradoc opened a portal in the House of Many Gates so Emeric could escape Maranor."
"Emeric fled to another world to keep Maranor from seizing his crown."
"Emeric took the Earth body of Viviane Saint-Lys and cast her soul into Nyil."
"Time runs faster on Earth: some two years on Nyil were thirty-three years there."
"In Viviane's body Emeric ran a great firm, married, and raised three children."
"Emeric sent Viviane a vault of her world's music, pictures and notes."
"Emeric lent Viviane weapons of her old world, then took them back."
"Emeric promised to aid Viviane in her hour of need and owes her a favour."
"Emeric sealed his talk with Viviane so she cannot speak of it to anyone."
"Emeric says godhood hardens the heart, with so many prayers left unanswered."
"Emeric has sired mortal children; none held his luck as strongly as Viviane."
"Emeric came back to Nyil at the war's end in the shape of a century-old Viviane."
"Emeric says he returned \"back from my own funeral\" on Earth."
"Emeric regained his throne once Maranor was cast out of Nyil."
